{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Golemworks\u00a0</strong></i>is an experimental fusion of tower defense and factory builder. You must assemble a factory that generates an army of automatons. These automatons automatically fight and defend your golem foundry from waves of encroaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/12cc25cd3aa2d9b4edf2a9f0ff9c1e92.poster.avif?t=1774229449\" width=708 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/12cc25cd3aa2d9b4edf2a9f0ff9c1e92.webm?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/12cc25cd3aa2d9b4edf2a9f0ff9c1e92.mp4?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molds</strong> activate on a cooldown, and generate a golem core - the 'recipe' for an automaton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/084a7f978c195895b5575abebaf2c477.poster.avif?t=1774229449\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/084a7f978c195895b5575abebaf2c477.webm?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/084a7f978c195895b5575abebaf2c477.mp4?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catalysts</strong>\u00a0are the production infrastructure. They can add levels, add elemental attributes, or otherwise alter a core </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.poster.avif?t=1774229449\" width=520 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.webm?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.mp4?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival will hinge on your ability to optimize the strength of your golem army. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable golem upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and varying difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All in-game art drawn by hand in Aseprite. Capsule art by @afique_asyraf</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Evidence of Golems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/aa763f680bc81efd355ea45c2a8b54095d5d9714.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/ffdf98976ce3338fc5afb524e8eb3934fb743853.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Precision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/7d08785b9f12a1cbef15a350de743eadce552352.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/3525abd5660ae5aedd699ac03241e868065a8090.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Tenacity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/2a79b8de9ad47001c0a68e3e376e9e7906ba204b.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Resolve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/0d85a0ed9b4cfd32a8dfc9487748660c311e1204.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Elements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/284c66dfe90dd2d22288202ec1acf97ebf70519e.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Tactics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/379ce85a0157ba77ee6a289a49727f5dd6d43032.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Engineering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/2680ed5431d1cae92cd68eb6ab1323d59b1584b7.jpg"},{"name":"Evidence of Production","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918970/984ae6b6507711d5a9e0565f86b0b05b3d6a66a6.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918970?t=1774229449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/da9a18622aedde0e897c1de58cf6727469a849a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774229449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/f2c7bedd64059c7f73be535edc919a709909cb3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774229449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/f2c7bedd64059c7f73be535edc919a709909cb3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774229449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":