, or otherwise alter a core </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.poster.avif?t=1774229449\" width=520 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.webm?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.mp4?t=1774229449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival will hinge on your ability to optimize the strength of your golem army. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable golem upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and varying difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All in-game art drawn by hand in Aseprite. Capsule art by @afique_asyraf</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["evilalbert"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/daa950371f409026fc8f79b250c475beffd445ec/header.jpg?t=1774229449","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, x86_64 CPU, ARMv7 or ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with